{"title":"2011 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are single-digit positive integers chosen independently and at random. What is the probability that the point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/8/8e8da0aef2d19017da7471378386d61620f288f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> lies above the parabola <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/3/91322d71a8047b18fcfd5404805bfb60edc069e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=ax^2-bx$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"101\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/2/f12eb7c304014b84dcd2cb2a6c4ad7821f882991.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{11}{81} \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{13}{81} \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{5}{27} \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{17}{81} \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{19}{81}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"413\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/8/8e8da0aef2d19017da7471378386d61620f288f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> lies above the parabola, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> must be greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/a/60a3ed3ace8b25d15740d21d631ef8135b6cc285.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y(a)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" />. We thus get the inequality <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/0/860766ff5d833f621e77751699877b7e87773827.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b&gt;a^3-ba$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"89\" height=\"15\" />. Solving this for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/6/596c673e8c11a273f0989d9775ef5e276876640a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b&gt;\\frac{a^3}{a+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"75\" height=\"40\" />. Now note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/2/232ca535c3fe9c6fe55f300a37f65601f0bfb0f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a^3}{a+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"43\" height=\"40\" /> constantly increases when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is positive. Then since this expression is greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/f/c7ffa3b8792f0170bce1ab6008e907343100d70e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, we can deduce that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> must be less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> in order for the inequality to hold, since otherwise <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> would be greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and not a single-digit integer. The only possibilities for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> are thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/2/502e059d1a020b368aee3a99c5669d88331d321f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/1/a51c461d0679e83325a8e86656e49639d72a5a94.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b&gt;\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"47\" height=\"38\" /> for our inequality, and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> can be any integer from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/a/55afdab16c8c49089c4d9ceeb8d3c8cf1f088be6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/9/0f90993ef5517be4725188bfcc14d704ef52aaea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b&gt;\\frac{8}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"43\" height=\"37\" /> for our inequality, and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> can be any integer from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/0/340605c5f88cf6864adc5b146c3dffca7a45df22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/b/ceb6d0fa8c385cdf13f8e800d79dad7e28b01581.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b&gt;\\frac{27}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"52\" height=\"37\" /> for our inequality, and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> can be any integer from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Finally, if we total up all the possibilities we see there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/b/efbfe273946ff9f971c5eab331ca39caa6fdf7f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> points that satisfy the condition, out of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/3/d63f3b079452c5ac922621901f783ded34903f2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9 \\times 9 = 81$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"81\" height=\"13\" /> total points. The probability of picking a point that lies above the parabola is thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/0/1401e0221fa9ad467ab95cda7a8d473c835ec8b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{19}{81} \\rightarrow \\boxed{\\textbf{E}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"74\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=u23iWcqbJlE\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=u23iWcqbJlE</a>\n~Shreyas S\n</p><p>this links to problem 11...\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A\" title=\"2011 AMC 12A\">2011 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2011 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2011 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2011 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2011 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2011 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2011 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2011 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2011 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2011 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2011 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2011 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2011 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2011 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2011 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2011 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2011 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2011 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2011 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2011 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2011 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2011 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2011 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2011 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2011 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2011 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2011 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2011 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2011 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_12_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 12 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 12 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017224230\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.038 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.069 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 302/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2298/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 158/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 7357/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   14.742      1 -total\n 52.63%    7.758      1 Template:AMC12_box\n 45.27%    6.674      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:9030:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017224230 and revision id 283388. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}